# FR-NOTI-003 / DEC-077 — Web Push (FCM Web). BUILD-TIME: changing these needs a
# rebuild of the web image, not a restart. Leave unset and push stays dormant:
# every entry point no-ops and the Firebase SDK is never loaded.
# From Firebase console -> Project settings -> General -> Your apps (Web app):
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
# From Project settings -> Cloud Messaging -> Web Push certificates -> Key pair:
VITE_FIREBASE_VAPID_KEY=
